OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786529901
OL,3,CMan begins 120-mile walk around Isle
OL,4,Cof Man in memory of friend
OL,6,FA man has begun a 120-mile walk around
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Man in memory of his
OL,8,Ffriend who took his own life.
OL,10,FCallum Ball, known as 'Backpack Boz',
OL,11,Fruns a mental health community project
OL,12,Fcalled Boz Cares, organising community
OL,13,Fmental-health activities and homeless-
OL,14,Fsupport projects in Merseyside.
OL,16,FHe has completed a number of
OL,17,Fchallenges in aid of the project, with
OL,18,Fhis next taking on the coastal
OL,19,Ffootpath around the Isle of Man - a
OL,20,Fchallenge he was due to complete with
OL,21,Fhis friend Connor Laverty.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
