FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786529901
OL,3,CMan begins 120-mile walk around Isle
OL,4,Cof Man in memory of friend
OL,6,FBut, at the end of July, just weeks
OL,7,Fbefore the walk got underway, Connor
OL,8,Ftook his own life.
OL,10,FDescribing Connor as 'like a little
OL,11,Fbrother', Callum, from Liverpool,
OL,12,Fsaid: "He always just had a big bright
OL,13,Fsmile, he was a lovely lad. Just
OL,14,Fproper kind heart, lovely soul, he'd
OL,15,Fdo absolutely anything for anybody."
OL,17,FAlongside raising awareness, Callum is
OL,18,Fraising money for James' Place, a UK
OL,19,Fcharity providing free therapy to men
OL,20,Faged 18 and over who are in 'suicidal
OL,21,Fcrisis'.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786529901
OL,3,CMan begins 120-mile walk around Isle
OL,4,Cof Man in memory of friend
OL,6,FHe said: "The suicide rates tell a
OL,7,Fwhole picture - the statistics don't
OL,8,Flie and it's just getting worse - and
OL,9,FLiverpool and the Isle of Man are
OL,10,Fvery, very similar with their mental
OL,11,Fhealth struggles.
OL,13,F"It's a massive problem over here, and
OL,14,FI'd go as far as calling it a pandemic
OL,15,Fto be totally honest with you, it's
OL,16,Fjust an absolute crisis, and it's not
OL,17,Fgood enough".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
