FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786529901
OL,3,CMan begins 120-mile walk around Isle
OL,4,Cof Man in memory of friend
OL,6,FCallum has previously walked
OL,7,Fapproximately 2,000 miles across the
OL,8,FUSA for men's mental health, and
OL,9,Fcompleted several other endurance
OL,10,Fchallenges.
OL,12,FHis journey will see him walking the
OL,13,Fcoastal footpath between Monday 10
OL,14,FAugust and Sunday 16 August.
OL,16,FOn the start line of the challenge,
OL,17,FCallum said: "I love this stuff. This
OL,18,Fis where I'm free, I'm at home. I'm
OL,19,Fhappy to just have my bag on, my Crocs
OL,20,Fon, and we're off!"
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
